*kkiyama117-nvim.txt*	Personal Neovim configuration

Author: kkiyama117
License: NYSL

==============================================================================
About                                                       *kkiyama117-nvim*

Personal Neovim configuration placed at `~/.config/nvim`.

Built around the Shougo ecosystem: >
	rvpm .......... plugin manager (Rust CLI, ahead-of-time loader.lua)
	denops.vim .... Deno runtime bridge
	ddc.vim ....... auto-completion (+ pum.vim, cmdline.vim)
	ddu.vim ....... fuzzy finder / UI framework
	ddt.vim ....... shell and terminal UI
<
Other pillars: kakehashi as the sole LSP client bridging every language
server (|kkiyama117-nvim-lsp.txt|), heirline.nvim statusline/tabline
(|kkiyama117-nvim-statusline.txt|), and skkeleton Japanese input.

